  "name": "ASI-Miji-Multimodal",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tASI-Miji-Multimodal\n\t\n\nArtificial Super Intelligence (ASI) multimodal research repository.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nASI-Miji-Multimodal is a centralized research repository containing datasets, notebooks, code, scientific resources, reasoning datasets, multimodal data, autonomous driving resources, materials science data, protein structure data, and AI development assets.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tContents\n\t\n\n\nReasoning datasets\nLogical reasoning\nSpatial reasoning\nScientific datasets\nMaterials\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Ashok080/ASI-Miji-Multimodal.",
